Package: videoshot
Architecture: any
Depends: ffmpeg,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: screenshot and videoshot application
 This tool takes a picture or a short video clip of the desktop, of a
 window or of a selected area, and saves it into a file or copies it to
 the clipboard. It is a fork of GNOME Screenshot as shipped by Linux Mint.
